OL,3,GNEWSATwo walkers rescued after becoming
OL,4,Astranded in snow and strong winds      
OL,6,FTwo walkers were rescued after getting 
OL,7,Finto difficulty in snow and strong     
OL,8,Fwinds in the Cairngorms.               
OL,10,FBraemar Mountain Rescue Team (MRT),    
OL,11,Fassisted by volunteers from Aberdeen   
OL,12,FMRT, were able to make contact with the
OL,13,Ftourists, who were stranded near       
OL,14,FLochnagar on Tuesday.                  
OL,16,FRescuers said they were able to work   
OL,17,Fout their general location after some  
OL,18,Finitial difficulty, partly due to a    
OL,19,Flanguage barrier.                      
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
